      "current_dead": null,
      "current_deleted": null,
      "current_title": "Ask HN: I built a site that just went ridiculously viral. What do I do now?",
      "excerpt": "Hey HN, So I built http://threewords.me - literally an MVP that I posted on Facebook and my friends started using. Fast forward 3 days. The entire Twitter results page for \"threewords.me\" is of tweets that happened less than five minutes ago. The site grew 2x in pageviews over the past hour . Two problems: 1) what do I do now? 2) how do I afford this? Advertising? Hosting partner? ...daresay... investment ? Sorry to be brief. If you're curious, the stack is Rails + Ruby Enter",
      "rank": 20,
      "guide_zh": "threewords.me 突然爆红，开发者求助如何应对成本与后续发展。"
